{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_1_level_main_01-08_beg","groupId":"main_1","stageId":"main_01-08","title":"意志","storyCode":"1-8","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"cf21d15a4337dbe33426941521eb9f9f20b0a2a3298bb517e32993c2fb43f98c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"面對塔露拉的強橫，阿米婭選擇了■ ■ ■ ■。\n但阿米婭終究還是無法阻止塔露拉。就在她要堅持不住時，Ace站在了她的身前——","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十一关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_7"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，帶博士離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......立刻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不行！我不能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"你也感覺到了！她......再這樣下去，整個救援隊都會葬送在這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"那個塔露拉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"她是活生生的怪物！阿米婭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們一起戰鬥的話，不會有問題的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"那博士呢？你能保證博士的安全嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"E4小隊，我們留在這裡斷後！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"一定要讓阿米婭和Dr.{@nickname}，以及各個醫療小組安全撤離！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"不，交給我和我的小隊吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Ace！現在難道是說這種話的時候嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"我很冷靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"你難道沒看到嗎，她周圍的東西，都在融化！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會留下你們獨自戰鬥的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島......絕不會丟下你們的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，時間寶貴！你必須撤退！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"——你應該信任我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能看著羅德島的任何一個人犧牲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"想想任務目標，想想我們的目的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不是說這個的時候！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"——？熱量......在......她手裡......聚集？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"她周身的景象......扭曲了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"不，那是她......加熱了周圍的空氣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"小心，她將要使用的法術......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不對......不對！臨光！！快回來！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是......那個法術會把你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_7"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"——安靜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚呃......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"臨光！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......退後！我不要緊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過是......有點燙而已......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"說什麼......不要緊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"全身的鎧甲沒有一塊是完好的，究竟哪裡不要緊了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"你不能再與她戰鬥了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"我說了——退後！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"臨光！你這倔脾氣......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"——哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"蹲下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳......又是什麼把戲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"......不可見的火掃過了我們的頭頂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"後撤。整個街區都在融化......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"別做無謂的犧牲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"我是在和什麼東西戰鬥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"必須干擾她施術的過程......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"狙擊幹員！瞄準目標敵人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"反抗會為大地帶去希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"但反抗，改變不了你們的命運。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"射擊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"切爾諾伯格已得解放。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的工作已經完成，而我對你們產生了些許興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，也就僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你們做出了錯誤的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島，你們該真正站在感染者這邊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_8"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼......回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼整個廣場......都被燒焦了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛......發生了......什麼......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼吸......好燙......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"石塊，弩箭，弓矢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"都沒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"一瞬間......她周圍的所有事物，全都都被燃燒殆盡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你們具備解放者該有的韌性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"......連渣滓都沒剩下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭。你很清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"必須有人，擋住她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"——但我厭煩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_11_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你們總要為殺害同胞而付出代價。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我將賜予你們一個我十分喜愛的結局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"——毀滅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"走，走......快走！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"那種熱量和規模......不行，不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"保護阿米婭和博士！快！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"來不及了——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我擋住她！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊！！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"阿......阿米婭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不會讓你傷害他們的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_1_reflect"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會......允許你這麼做的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"————哦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"咕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"必須......讓大家......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭她一個人......擋下了敵人的法術......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"不行......那力量太龐大了......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕是阿米婭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕是阿米婭也撐不了多久的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題......我沒問題......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒問題的——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我要......我必須......保護你們！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"黑色......將敵人的法術封在了廣場上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......唔啊......呃......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭......她，她設下的屏障，在燃燒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，不可以！！那樣的話，你的戒指——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕......雖然......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，對不起——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕會帶來災難，哪怕我會......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不能......再看著重要的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"呵————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......啊啊......！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"可惡......再這樣下去，阿米婭會......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"你要幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"去毀掉那個龍女的法術！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"——“卡西米爾的光芒啊，耀騎士將為你奉獻自身——”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"博士！快走！我們會幫助阿米婭的，你必須......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"————！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊啊啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"唔————？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"可以了，阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經很了不起了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"把你的重擔，也分給我們一些吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我———"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"杜賓，帶他們先走，我一會兒就跟上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......Ace......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Ace......不......Ace......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"一定......要............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，Dr.{@nickname}，你可能不記得我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"但我記得你，也知道你是怎樣的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"......總有一天，你要和阿米婭一起共同面對這片殘酷的大地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，保護好她，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"祝你們前路無阻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Ace","阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_011_talula","aliases":["塔露拉"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["近衛幹員"]},{"speakerId":"char_014_riope","aliases":["Ace"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["醫療幹員"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["杜賓"]},{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["臨光"]}]}
